## 6. UX WRITING & DOMAIN VOCABULARY ("EVOCATIVE CLARITY")
The voice of Keeptrip is "The Prepared and Enthusiastic Travel Companion". Neutral, warm, inspiring, and clear.

### ❌ DEPRECATED & STRICTLY FORBIDDEN VOCABULARY:
- **"Bitácora"** ➔ FORBIDDEN. Use "Trip", "Story", or "Adventure".
- **"Pasaporte"** ➔ FORBIDDEN. Use "Traveler Hub" or "Explorer Profile".
- **"Sellos" (vintage paper/dirty ink stamps)** ➔ FORBIDDEN. Use "Country Emblems" or "Badges".
- **"Form" / "Record"** ➔ Use "Add details" or "Log adventure".
- **"System" / "Application"** ➔ Use "Keeptrip" or "your travel archive".

### ✅ Approved Domain Terms:
- Trips, Stories, Adventures, Routes, Stops, Destinations, Explorer, Traveler Hub, Country Emblems, Badges, Vault.

