## 7. TARGETED TESTING & TOKEN CONSERVATION PROTOCOL
To protect context window limits and avoid massive log dumps:
1. **NEVER run full test suites:** Never run `npm test`, `npm run test`, or bare `npx vitest run`.
2. **Run targeted single-file tests only:**
   `npx vitest run src/entities/viajes/model/viajeSchema.test.js`
   `npx vitest run src/shared/lib/utils/viajeUtils.test.js`
3. **Playwright E2E Tests:** Execute Playwright E2E tests only when explicitly commanded by the milestone.
4. **Test Mocks:** Rely on existing stubs in `__mocks__/` (`framer-motion.js`, `lucide-react.js`) to avoid memory leaks.

---

## 8. SECURITY, PERFORMANCE & CLOUD RESOURCE SAFETY
- **Zero N+1 Writes:** Never update collections inside loops. Always use dirty-checking diffs and `writeBatch`.
- **Firestore Safety:** Never perform unindexed mass queries. For global platform counters and analytics, read exclusively from aggregated summary documents (`_system/metrics_summary`). Enforce tenant security via `firestore.rules`.
- **Firebase Storage & Paywall:** Intercept uploads on the client side (`useEdicionGalleryManager.js`) BEFORE initiating byte transfer if a Free tier quota is exceeded.
- **Mapbox & WebGL:** Pause animation loops (`requestAnimationFrame` in `SpinGlobe.js`) and unmount WebGL canvases whenever the map is off-screen or full-screen modals are active.